{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":16036,\"date\":\"2026-07-08T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-08T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-4-ios-26-6-e-altri-sistemi-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 4 di iOS 26.6 e degli altri sistemi: cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione la quarta beta per sviluppatori di iOS 26.6, insieme alle nuove beta di iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e HomePod 26.6.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/ios-26.6-beta-4-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26.6-beta-4\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16030,\"date\":\"2026-07-08T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-08T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"siri-ai-arriva-su-apple-watch-con-watchos-27-beta-3\",\"title\":\"Siri AI arriva su Apple Watch con watchOS 27 beta 3\",\"excerpt\":\"Con watchOS 27 beta 3, Apple abilita Siri AI e l’app Siri direttamente su Apple Watch, con elaborazione tramite un iPhone compatibile e sincronizzazione delle conversazioni tra i dispositivi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16028,\"date\":\"2026-07-08T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-08T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"disponibili-le-beta-4-di-ios-26-6-e-delle-piattaforme-apple\",\"title\":\"Disponibili le beta 4 di iOS 26.6 e delle piattaforme Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato la beta 4 di iOS 26.6, insieme alle versioni beta 4 di iPadOS 26.6, macOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e watchOS 26.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/ios-26-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15868,\"date\":\"2026-06-30T10:42:33+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-30T08:42:33+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-3-ios-26-6-novita\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 3 di iOS 26.6: novità su iPadOS, macOS, watchOS, tvOS e visionOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple distribuisce la beta 3 di iOS 26.6 e delle piattaforme collegate: iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/ios-26.6-beta-3-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-26.6-beta-3\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15769,\"date\":\"2026-06-26T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-26T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-nuova-beta-watchos-27-per-apple-watch-ultra-3\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia una nuova beta di watchOS 27 per Apple Watch Ultra 3\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito una nuova beta di watchOS 27 dedicata ad Apple Watch Ultra 3. L’aggiornamento arriva oltre due settimane dalla prima beta e introduce Siri AI, nuove funzioni per Smart Stack e Find My, oltre a ottimizzazioni delle prestazioni.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15721,\"date\":\"2026-06-24T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-24T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-beta-2-disponibile-su-alcuni-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27 beta 2 disponibile su alcuni Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato watchOS 27 developer beta 2 su alcuni Apple Watch, completando la seconda ondata di beta estive dedicate agli sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27--768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27-\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15684,\"date\":\"2026-06-22T14:28:13+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-22T12:28:13+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-roadmap-prossimi-18-mesi-20-prodotti-attesi\",\"title\":\"Apple, la roadmap dei prossimi 18 mesi è enorme: ecco i 20 prodotti attesi\",\"excerpt\":\"Una panoramica dei 20 prodotti attesi nei prossimi 18 mesi per Apple, tra aggiornamenti di piattaforme e nuove linee di prodotto.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Keynote_Steve-Jobs-Theater_09122018.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Keynote_Steve-Jobs-Theater_09122018\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15670,\"date\":\"2026-06-22T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-22T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-cinque-nuove-app-siri-ai-remote-find-my-watch-pass-designer\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta cinque nuove app: Siri AI, Remote, Find My su Watch e Pass Designer\",\"excerpt\":\"Da WWDC 2026 arrivano Siri AI con app dedicata, il ritorno di Apple TV Remote, la nuova app Find My su Apple Watch e Pass Designer per Wallet. In parallelo, Claris aggiorna FileMaker Go 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15650,\"date\":\"2026-06-21T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-21T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-spiega-perche-watchos-27-perde-supporto-su-molti-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"Apple spiega perché watchOS 27 perde supporto su molti Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 non arriverà su Apple Watch Series 6, 7, 8, SE 2 e sul primo Apple Watch Ultra. Per questi modelli restano solo aggiornamenti di sicurezza.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Watch-Ultra-Orange-Alpine-Loop-Action-button-220907_big.jpg.large_-768x315.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-Orange-Alpine-Loop-Action-button-220907_big.jpg.large_\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15620,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-novita-siri-ai-fitness\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: tutte le novità per Apple Watch, tra Siri AI e nuove funzioni fitness\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 arriva su Apple Watch in autunno con Siri AI sul polso, una nuova griglia dinamica delle app, miglioramenti a Liquid Glass e funzioni fitness più precise.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchOS-27-Hands-On-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchOS-27-Hands-On-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15557,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-watchos-26-6-tvos-26-6-visionos-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le seconde beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito agli sviluppatori la seconda tornata di beta di watchOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e visionOS 26.6. Le nuove versioni arrivano tre settimane dopo la prima beta e sono disponibili tramite le Impostazioni dei dispositivi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":9,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15546,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-2-ios-26-6-e-versioni-per-ipados-macos-tvos-watchos-26\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 2 di iOS 26.6 e le versioni per iOS, iPadOS, macOS, tvOS e watchOS\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibile la seconda beta di iOS 26.6, insieme alle beta 2 di iPadOS 26.6, macOS 26.6, tvOS 26.6 e watchOS 26.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iOS-26.6-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15521,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-prestazioni-e-griglia-dinamica-per-le-app\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: nuove prestazioni e una griglia dinamica per le app\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 porta miglioramenti prestazionali e una griglia dinamica delle app: cinque app in base al contesto, richiamabili con la Digital Crown. Richiede hardware più recente.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15501,\"date\":\"2026-06-15T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-15T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"supporto-software-apple-interrompe-16-dispositivi-autunno\",\"title\":\"Supporto software in calo: Apple interrompe l’aggiornamento per 16 dispositivi\",\"excerpt\":\"In autunno Apple terminerà il supporto software per 16 dispositivi tra Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e Apple TV. I tagli più ampi riguardano Apple Watch, mentre macOS 27 sancisce la fine dei Mac Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Top-Half-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Top-Half\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15464,\"date\":\"2026-06-13T19:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-13T16:59:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-nuove-app-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27 porta nuove app su Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Con watchOS 27 arrivano due nuove app su Apple Watch, ampliando l’offerta disponibile direttamente sul dispositivo indossabile.\",\"categoryName\":\"Applicazioni\",\"categorySlug\":\"applicazioni\",\"categoryId\":13,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchos-27.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos-27.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15366,\"date\":\"2026-06-09T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T19:57:55+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-taglia-supporto-apple-watch-series-9-ultra-1-se-2\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27 taglia il supporto per Apple Watch Series 9, Ultra 1 e SE 2\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 non supporterà Apple Watch Series 9, Apple Watch Ultra (prima generazione) e Apple Watch SE (seconda generazione). La compatibilità si ferma ai modelli con chip S9/S10.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Watch-Series-9-Pink-Aluminum-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-9-Pink-Aluminum-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15275,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-pubblica-wallpaper-playlist-video-get-ready-per-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica wallpaper, playlist e video “Get Ready” per WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Prima dell’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple rende disponibili una nuova wallpaper per iPhone, iPad e Mac, una playlist su Apple Music e un video “Get Ready” per prepararsi all’evento.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC-2026-Wallpaper-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC-2026-Wallpaper\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15273,\"date\":\"2026-06-02T03:15:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-02T01:15:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-manca-una-settimana-placeholder-youtube-keynote-diretta\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026, manca una settimana: placeholder YouTube e keynote in diretta\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dall’inizio di WWDC 2026, Apple ha attivato un placeholder su YouTube con promemoria per il keynote del 8 giugno. La diretta sarà disponibile anche su Apple Events e Apple TV.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"WWDC26-Glowing-Ring-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15156,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-watchos-26-6-tv